# OctoAcme Decision Authority & RACI Matrix

## Purpose
Clarify who makes which decisions at each stage of the project lifecycle to reduce delays and ambiguity.

---

## Decision Authority by Phase

### Initiation Phase

| Decision | Authority | Consulted | Informed |
|----------|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Approve project to move to planning | Sponsor + Product Lead | Project Manager, Team Lead | Stakeholders |
| Define success metrics | Product Manager | Data Analyst, Team Lead | Sponsor, Stakeholders |
| Identify initial risks | Project Manager | Developers, Product Manager | Team |
| Approve initial timeline estimate | Project Manager | Developers | Sponsor |

### Planning Phase

| Decision | Authority | Consulted | Informed |
|----------|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Finalize scope and backlog | Product Manager | Developers, Project Manager | Team, Stakeholders |
| Approve sprint/iteration length | Scrum Master + Team | Project Manager | Stakeholders |
| Set Definition of Done | Team + QA/Testing | Project Manager | Stakeholders |
| Approve release timeline | Project Manager | Product Manager, Developers | Sponsor, Stakeholders |
| Prioritize backlog items | Product Manager | Developers, Stakeholders | Team |

### Execution Phase

| Decision | Authority | Consulted | Informed |
|----------|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Accept PR / merge to main | Developers (peer review) | QA/Testing, Project Manager | Team |
| Sign off on feature acceptance | QA/Testing + Product Manager | Developers | Team |
| Escalate blocker (Level 1) | Scrum Master + Team | Project Manager | - |
| Escalate blocker (Level 2) | Project Manager + Product Manager | Team leads | Sponsor |
| Change scope mid-sprint | Product Manager | Project Manager, Team | Sponsor, Stakeholders |

### Release Phase

| Decision | Authority | Consulted | Informed |
|----------|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Approve release readiness | DevOps + QA/Testing | Developers, Product Manager | Project Manager |
| Schedule production deployment | Project Manager + DevOps | Product Manager, On-call | Stakeholders, Support |
| Approve rollback | DevOps + Product Manager | Project Manager | Team, Stakeholders |
| Release communication timing | Product Manager + Project Manager | Marketing, Support | Stakeholders, Customers |

### Close & Retrospective Phase

| Decision | Authority | Consulted | Informed |
|----------|-----------|-----------|----------|
| Schedule retrospective | Scrum Master | Project Manager, Team | Stakeholders |
| Prioritize action items | Team + Scrum Master | Project Manager | Sponsor |
| Capture lessons learned | Project Manager | Team | Organization |

